Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)贝库塔……特意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们叫出来 有何贵干？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)若是无聊的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不会轻易放过你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)高兴吧。同伴复活了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.99,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古！阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你们到底是怎么做到的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在人间界用尽了力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷入了永久的沉眠难道不是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)因为你们太不争气了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害我没法安心睡觉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易同伴复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好歹欢迎一下他们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈艾)哈——喽晚安！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各位 久等了为您送上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝佳的超棒情报！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦！？ 不是叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)原来如此…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 那个所谓的斯巴达城遗迹里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(羽惠)是的 恐怕 九十九游马也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.01,0:01:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在前往那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被那么锐利的目光盯着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}脸… 脸 好痒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)也就是说在那遗迹等着的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那群家伙就会从对面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己送上门来是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马是我的猎物！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)我一定我要亲手把他打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)飞行船上显示的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个 No.所在遗迹的位置是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里，斯巴达城。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前的地方不一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个挺热闹的地方啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)久等了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)尽是些可爱的衣服我都挑花眼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)璃绪小姐，斯巴达城
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说意面和披萨也很好吃呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀！真不错呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)“大家都去街上调查了”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)“俺就一个人看家”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～！好寂寞啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过……有 No.的遗迹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座城市里该去哪里找才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是呢 就算盲目地找也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)发现什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个！ 看那个啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]斯巴达城 职业决斗锦标赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的…… 脑子里真的只有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的事呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是那个啦。是那个决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]谜之最强蒙面决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}五右卫门·THE·星人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)五右卫门·THE·星人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((五右卫门：就是嗨起来啦！))
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是五右卫门那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]来吧 在满场欢呼声中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}动力卡组的使用者这位选手入场了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]油淋鸡·肌肉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥利)奥利！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]他的对手是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如彗星般现身的神秘蒙面人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]高斯·扎·斯塔曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:05:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)高斯！高斯！高斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]自称来自星辰的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高斯·扎·斯塔曼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]在孩子们当中也超有人气！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(孩子们)高斯！高斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 气氛真不错啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高斯·扎·斯塔曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把奥利什么的 赶紧揍趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙的星星已经坠地了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！直接攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高斯·扎·斯塔曼 压倒性的胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)高斯！高斯！高斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就是冠军战了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会赢的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，包在我身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也给我签个名吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Goosh，德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦、哦你……游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过真是吓一跳啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到Goosh居然成了制作人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人气好高啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然，来自星星的使者——
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Goosh·The·Starman。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连战连胜，接下来要挑战冠军了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在也是制作人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）不，我是这家伙的经纪人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来我说两个人一起当蒙面双人决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出道吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他说不要。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（摆线！））
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确、确实。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能有点难受。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是为什么要叫星之使者？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是想啊，给孩子们看看希望之星。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和多洛瓦出生的城市是个烂地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是活下去就已经拼尽全力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是只有决斗，是闪闪发光的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种让人兴奋不已的热血决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一边想着总有一天我们也要那样一边做着梦啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知不觉间那个梦变成了我们的希望之星。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管多么黑暗的夜晚只要天上有闪亮的星星{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能朝着它活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的希望之星我想让现在的小鬼们看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我才要当星之使者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我成了银河星人哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，我是不是说了些不像我会说的话啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有那种事。这不是个好梦想嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河，你的梦想我完全能明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我也一直想着要拯救心园，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直战斗到现在啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟某个不珍惜妹妹的家伙真是天差地别呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说回来，你们为什么会来这座城市？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实我们是在找遗迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎光临。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您要点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座城市里的告诉我关于遗迹的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(戈修)那个遗迹里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有你老爸的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}线索，是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 关于遗迹的传说之类的也一并说说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话 倒是有一个很有名的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在斗兽场遗迹中徘徊的拳斗士之魂的传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个传说是怎样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多洛瓦)据说 曾经在这片土地上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅凭自己的双拳不断获胜的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的拳斗士。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙有个对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是那个国家的王子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拳斗士与王子两人通过无数次交战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越了身份 孕育出了同为战士的羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(戈修)那样的两人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决出雌雄的时刻到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 在众多观众面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王子落败这种事是不被允许的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亲信们给拳斗士安上莫须有的罪名将其逮捕。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拳斗士拼命申诉自己的清白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为对手的王子也为他辩护{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却不被采纳最终 在众多观众的注视下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拳斗士被残忍地处刑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多罗瓦)漫长的岁月流逝那个国家灭亡了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}斗兽场化为遗迹之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据说那里仍有拳斗士的灵魂在徘徊游荡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因莫须有的罪名被处刑的怨恨残留下来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是还没打够啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没能和对手一决胜负就倒下的遗憾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这家伙的灵魂留在了竞技场里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 那座遗迹如今也在湖底了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 遗迹沉到湖里去了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轰隆）据说为了封印彷徨的拳斗士之魂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修筑了堤坝把水灌了进去。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～ 那怎么办啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马上就要天黑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的明天再说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《遗迹在湖底吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙好像还没来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那我就稍微那就来打发下时间吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((下次就是冠军赛了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会赢的对吧))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 就凭我居然会因为压力睡不着。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是不妙的节奏啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得拳斗士之魂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会拥有无与伦比的力量 吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信了传说 半夜跑到这种地方来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明遗迹就在湖底的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}湖的样子很奇怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}湖水在退。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.67,0:11:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是 No.族的遗迹？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那巴利安的那些家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话，No.族就。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有种
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常不祥的预感。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（决斗盘）怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行啊，吃那么多意面的话会胖的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，到底是怎么回事…啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竞技场出现了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉，这么晚了还叫你出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意，你很急吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，高修那家伙到底
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪儿晃悠呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是什么感觉……》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)那是 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是这座遗迹的 No.怪兽吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 要抵抗吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有炽热斗志之人无法继承我的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我问你 在你心中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}渴望战斗的炽热斗志可有否。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 有啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把九十九游马打趴下这份炽热的斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道……你是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……相当强力的 No.怪兽嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 相应地 使用它的决斗者风险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也很大吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(高修)喂 你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那儿干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)这家伙 记得是职业决斗者的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高修！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高修…为什么你会在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.34,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有栖川！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直都在担心你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一直在担心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}担心你是不是被除我以外的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等不及想打一场想得受不了了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在的你对我来说太烫手了》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 游马。这到底
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是什么个气氛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是你的熟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此 只要用这个大家伙…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你叫戈什来着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙暂时借给你用！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是 No.众……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那家伙跟我一起打倒九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……阿里特 你……戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切……都是为了异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会去洗脑戈什……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 是什么人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是异晶七皇之一 阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:15:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是和菲卡博士一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经毁灭了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易人凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来场双人决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双人决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要解开戈什的洗脑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能靠决斗赢下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，那就上吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来当你的搭档。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是高须的经理人。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然那家伙的心落入了敌人手中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那把它夺回来的人，就是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙可不是普通人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连我都……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就交给德罗瓦吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我摆出更高兴的表情啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是一直想着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要再跟我决斗一场吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊，我一直想着。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那时候起，就一直想再和你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想来一场火热的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是… 为什么要用把豪树
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也卷进来这种下三滥的手段…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙的用途我可是有好好考虑过的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用途？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}废话到此为止！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 那就来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我。我的回合 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤 英雄挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伏击士兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}豪树…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《有栖… 你为什么… 为什么…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 游马。愤怒会让人判断失误。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道… 我知道啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘎嘎嘎魔术师)嘎嘎嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动永续魔法 嘎嘎嘎镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的1只嘎嘎嘎怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和相同等级的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎镜进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(霍普)霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就请出王牌啊真是热血过头呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管哪个玩家第1回合不能攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，直到其中一方的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}标签被彻底打爆为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都会继续下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再盖放2张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)总觉得那个叫有人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和之前的气氛完全不一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤英雄挑战者 利刃之刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动伏击士兵的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在1回合以上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}留在自己场上之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将2只等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄挑战者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为等级1
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以进行特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 双枪！夜袭的坎特拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级1的双枪 夜袭的坎特拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用簇刃刀进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.54！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炽热斗志的咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连沉睡的灵魂也为之震颤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反骨的斗志 狮心！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 这座遗迹的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力仅仅100！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击表示的狮心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.09,0:20:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.77,0:20:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 狮心攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是自杀行为啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是自己要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去挨那2400的伤害吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动狮心兽的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这只怪兽战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家受到的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轰啸）燃烧反击！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰啸！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞄准同归于尽的舍身战术吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过要舍身的不是我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是那个大块头就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈 好好跟游马互相残杀吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有码！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底是怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.65,0:21:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 应该不是会用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种战斗方式的家伙吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 输给你的怨恨把我改变了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.18,0:23:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.79,0:23:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.12,0:23:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.93,0:23:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.25,0:24:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
